<title>SPAIN: Union Fenosa to pay net interim dividend 19.5 ptas.</title>
<headline>Union Fenosa to pay net interim dividend 19.5 ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electricity firm Union Fenosa said on Tuesday it would pay a net interim dividend of 19.5 pesetas per share on January 2.</p>
<p>&quot;The board has agreed to pay a gross interim dividend of 26 pesetas per share, which equates to a net dividend of 19.5 pesetas,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
